OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786342684
OL,3,CFour sentenced four years after a man
OL,4,Cfound dead in his home
OL,6,FA lengthy Thames Valley Police
OL,7,Finvestigation has led to four people
OL,8,Fbeing sentenced for various offences
OL,9,Fin connection with the death of a man
OL,10,Fin Oxford on 24 April 2022.
OL,12,FPeter Crowley, who was 50, was found
OL,13,Finside his home in Brome Place in
OL,14,FHeadington leading to the launch of a
OL,15,Fmurder investigation.
OL,17,FIt found on the previous day he'd been
OL,18,Fwalking home with a friend when they
OL,19,Fwere approached by two people, Mason
OL,20,FRobins and Tia Pomeroy.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
