OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786342684
OL,3,CFour sentenced four years after a man
OL,4,Cfound dead in his home
OL,6,FPomeroy, who was 16 at the time,
OL,7,Fattacked Mr Crowley which was linked
OL,8,Fto the earlier non-suspicious death of
OL,9,FMr Crowley's partner - Gemma Pomeroy -
OL,10,Fthe aunt of Tia.
OL,12,FMr Crowley was taken home by a friend
OL,13,Fand was alive when they left - but the
OL,14,Fnext day emergency services pronounced
OL,15,Fhim dead at his home.
OL,17,FA post mortem examination found his
OL,18,Fdeath was caused by mixed drug
OL,19,Ftoxicity and alcoholic liver disease
OL,20,Fand not due to an assault, so the
OL,21,Fmurder investigation was discontinued.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786342684
OL,3,CFour sentenced four years after a man
OL,4,Cfound dead in his home
OL,6,FHowever, extensive enquiries continued
OL,7,Finto the actions of four people in the
OL,8,Flead up to his death, which found Tia
OL,9,FPomeroy had assaulted him.
OL,11,FThe court heard, after the incident
OL,12,Finvolving Mr Crowley, Pomeroy and
OL,13,FRobins were assisted by others who
OL,14,Fbelieved they were wanted in
OL,15,Fconnection with the investigation.
OL,17,FIt found attempts had been made to
OL,18,Fmove and harbour suspects following Mr
OL,19,FCrowley's death, subsequently
OL,20,Ffrustrating the police investigation.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786342684
OL,3,CFour sentenced four years after a man
OL,4,Cfound dead in his home
OL,6,FThat led to the arrest of Morton
OL,7,FMorton and Michaela Pomeroy.
OL,9,FOn 18 December 2025 Morton Morton,
OL,10,Fwho's 35, of Coriander Way, Oxford,
OL,11,Fwas unanimously convicted at Oxford
OL,12,FCrown Court on 18 December 2025 of
OL,13,Fperverting the course of justice.
OL,15,FMichaela Pomeroy, who's 33, of
OL,16,FStowford Road, Oxford, was unanimously
OL,17,Fconvicted on 4 June 2026 at the same
OL,18,Fcourt of perverting the course of
OL,19,Fjustice.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786342684
OL,3,CFour sentenced four years after a man
OL,4,Cfound dead in his home
OL,6,FYesterday (Aug 7), they were both
OL,7,Fjailed for one year and two months for
OL,8,Fthe offences.
OL,10,FTia Pomeroy, who's 20, of Stowford
OL,11,FRoad, Headington, was unanimously
OL,12,Fconvicted on 18 December 2025 of
OL,13,Fassault occasioning actual bodily harm
OL,14,F(ABH) and perverting the course of
OL,15,Fjustice by avoiding arrest and
OL,16,Ffrustrating the police investigation.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786342684
OL,3,CFour sentenced four years after a man
OL,4,Cfound dead in his home
OL,6,F21 year old Mason Robins, of
OL,7,FElderfield Road, Bicester, was
OL,8,Funanimously convicted on the same date
OL,9,Fof perverting the course of justice by
OL,10,Favoiding arrest and frustrating the
OL,11,Finvestigation.
OL,13,FTia Pomeroy has now been sentenced to
OL,14,Ftwo years' detention, suspended for 18
OL,15,Fmonths, and Robins to one years'
OL,16,Fimprisonment, suspended for 18 months.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
