OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786342684
OL,3,CFour sentenced four years after a man
OL,4,Cfound dead in his home
OL,6,FInvestigating officer Detective
OL,7,FConstable Kevin Smith from the Major
OL,8,FCrime Unit said: "Firstly, my thoughts
OL,9,Fremain with the family and friends of
OL,10,FPeter Crowley.
OL,12,FThey have had to endure a long and
OL,13,Fdifficult journey since Peter's death,
OL,14,Fand I hope that these convictions
OL,15,Fprovide them with some measure of
OL,16,Fjustice.
OL,18,FPeter was subjected to an assault by
OL,19,FTia Pomeroy prior to passing away.
OL,26,@pD@ROU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786342684
OL,3,CFour sentenced four years after a man
OL,4,Cfound dead in his home
OL,6,FThe assault was a wholly unnecessary
OL,7,Fattack and although it was found that
OL,8,Fthe assault by Pomeroy on Peter was
OL,9,Fnot a causative factor to his death,
OL,10,Fthe evidence presented during the
OL,11,Finvestigation and at court
OL,12,Fdemonstrated the involvement of those
OL,13,Fresponsible, and the jury's verdicts
OL,14,Freflect the strength of that evidence.
OL,16,FThis case also highlighted the actions
OL,17,Fof others who sought to assist those
OL,18,Fresponsible after the offence had been
OL,19,Fcommitted.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G8/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786342684
OL,3,CFour sentenced four years after a man
OL,4,Cfound dead in his home
OL,6,FRather than allowing the criminal
OL,7,Fjustice process to take its course,
OL,8,Fsteps were taken to move and harbour
OL,9,Fsuspects and frustrate the police
OL,10,Finvestigation.
OL,12,FSuch actions undermined our
OL,13,Finvestigations and caused further
OL,14,Fdistress to Peter's family and friends.
OL,16,FThese convictions are the result of a
OL,17,Fthorough and painstaking investigation
OL,18,Finvolving specialist detectives,
OL,19,Fforensic experts, uniformed officers
OL,20,Fand partner agencies.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G9/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786342684
OL,3,CFour sentenced four years after a man
OL,4,Cfound dead in his home
OL,6,FI would like to thank everyone who
OL,7,Fcontributed to the investigation, as
OL,8,Fwell as members of the public who
OL,9,Fprovided information and supported our
OL,10,Fenquiries.
OL,12,FThames Valley Police remains committed
OL,13,Fto pursuing not only those who commit
OL,14,Fthe most serious offences, but also
OL,15,Fthose who seek to protect offenders or
OL,16,Fobstruct investigations.
OL,18,FWe will continue to work tirelessly to
OL,19,Fensure that those responsible are
OL,20,Fidentified, brought before the courts
OL,21,Fand held accountable for their actions.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G10/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
