PN,38511
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786342684
OL,3,CFour sentenced four years after a man
OL,4,Cfound dead in his home
OL,6,FFinally, I would again like to pay
OL,7,Ftribute to Peter's family, who have
OL,8,Fshown remarkable dignity and strength
OL,9,Fthroughout the investigation and court
OL,10,Fproceedings."
OL,26,@rD@MO]
